# The kernel services amdgpu reaches when linked, directly or through the
# objects of Stela's Linux environment, that nothing supplies yet or that the
# environment defines only as a trap, by service. `build/amdgpu.rs` fails the
# build when this list and the compiled imports differ.

# amdgpu's own interrupt unit, amdgpu_irq.c, which waits for IRQ domains
# (BLOCKED in amdgpu.rs).
